{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:49 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:49 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:49 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"香港大學站附近有信號設備故障。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/4b48b22f13eea874ffc592efd7c55bb7/2026-11/page_150.jpg\"/><p>今日（18日）早上8時46分，港鐵表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。現時港島綫列車服務受阻，整體行車時間（總站至總站）預計需要額外5至8分鐘。港鐵呼籲乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p><p>香港大學站附近有信號設備故障。資料圖片</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:23:20.083314+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:49:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:16:48.750505+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:16:48.750505+00:00","content_hash":"577985cdf827b10b43ae583953c6d6974fa5bca18cc173df6256a06b5cf1073d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}